<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10648] Ignite hang to stop if node wasn&apos;t started completely. GridTcpRestNioListener hangs on latch.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10648</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If Ignition.start waits on rebalance then&#160;GridRestProcessor is not started yet&#160;then we call Ingition.stop and&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;GridTcpRestNioListener hangs on&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;if (marshMapLatch.getCount() &amp;gt; 0)&lt;br/&gt;
 U.awaitQuiet(marshMapLatch);&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;cause wasn&apos;t counted down on start.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
